kind: note
tags: note
Note page: one idea in a few paragraphs
title end

paragraph start
Use a note page to capture one idea. It has a title and paragraphs, and it cannot hold sections, so it stays small. If the idea grows, move it to a bigger page type.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Write the idea so a reader could restate it in one sentence, and keep each paragraph to one point.
paragraph end

comment start
one idea in a few paragraphs, no sections
comment end

